# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The source code is available [on GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"
msgstr "Zdrojový kód je dostupný [na GitHubu](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "Příručka pro vývojáře se nachází v souboru [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) v kořenovém adresáři repozitáře tohoto projektu. Účastí se zavazuješ dodržovat [kodex chování](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) Qiskitu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) for tracking requests and bugs.\n"
msgstr "Pro sledování požadavků a chyb používáme [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose).\n"

